Linus,

The following changes since commit 6681bc0deba495fad0d6fb349e40524abd1b1732:

  Merge tag 'asoc-3.4' of git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/broonie/sound into for-linus (2012-03-21 08:06:05 +0100)

are available in the git repository at:


  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound.git tags/sound-3.4

for you to fetch changes up to c578ae0026da81a589245ee08e0fd1b1d8a55f4e:

  ALSA: fix isa/opti9xx module param type (2012-03-29 17:57:08 +0200)

----------------------------------------------------------------
sound fixes for 3.4-rc1

A collection of small fixes for 3.4-rc1, including
- mic-recording regression fix for Realtek codec
- clean-up of dmaengine parameter mess
- WM8894 calibration tweak
- minor fixes for asihpi and some bool module parms

----------------------------------------------------------------
Dan Carpenter (1):
      ALSA: asihpi - fix return type of hpios_locked_mem_alloc()

Fabio Estevam (1):
      ASoC: Add extra parameter to device_prep_dma_cyclic

Mark Brown (1):
      ASoC: wm8994: Update WM8994 DCS calibration

Randy Dunlap (2):
      sound: fix oss/msnd_pinnacle module param type
      ALSA: fix isa/opti9xx module param type

Takashi Iwai (2):
      ALSA: hda/realtek - Fix ADC assignment with a shared HP/Mic pin
      Merge tag 'asoc-3.4' of git://git.kernel.org/.../broonie/sound into for-linus

Vinod Koul (1):
      ASoC: dmaengine_pcm: use dmaengine cyclic wrapper

